asr-002280
02:19:19.600 --> 02:19:21.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: in terms of social services.

asr-002281
02:19:21.480 --> 02:19:23.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang concern po siyempre ay,

