CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Kaya nga po, we have, we submit our needed budget

asr-002292
02:19:50.760 --> 02:19:55.680
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: that would cater our needs in the university

asr-002293
02:19:55.680 --> 02:19:58.920
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: to really address the three core function

asr-002294
02:19:58.920 --> 02:20:00.220
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: of the university,

asr-002295
02:20:00.220 --> 02:20:03.540
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: the instruction, research and extension.

asr-002296
02:20:04.160 --> 02:20:07.620
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So ang sina-submit ng university na budget

asr-002297
02:20:07.620 --> 02:20:10.960
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: will address the advanced degree

asr-002298
02:20:10.960 --> 02:20:12.860
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: and training of our faculty.

asr-002299
02:20:13.560 --> 02:20:17.360
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Also include there is the construction

asr-002300
02:20:17.360 --> 02:20:21.180
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: of additional classroom and upgrading of facilities,

asr-002301
02:20:21.580 --> 02:20:24.280
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: including the digital transformation.

asr-002302
02:20:24.280 --> 02:20:26.880
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And on top of the,

asr-002303
02:20:26.880 --> 02:20:28.480
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: also included in

asr-002304
02:20:28.480 --> 02:20:29.540
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: the proposed budget

asr-002305
02:20:29.540 --> 02:20:32.620
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: is their participation in advanced training

asr-002306
02:20:32.620 --> 02:20:35.920
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: and collaboration with the local

asr-002307
02:20:35.920 --> 02:20:37.880
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: and international university.

asr-002308
02:20:38.200 --> 02:20:41.160
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Lahat po under the MOOE,

asr-002309
02:20:41.280 --> 02:20:43.800
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: under the capital outlay and personnel

asr-002310
02:20:43.800 --> 02:20:50.020
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: are, are, uh, properly, uh, calculated and submitted.

asr-002311
02:20:50.020 --> 02:20:52.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So kung ito ay makukulangan,

asr-002312
02:20:53.000 --> 02:20:55.940
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: the set target for quality education

asr-002313
02:20:55.940 --> 02:20:58.660
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: across the academic program

asr-002314
02:20:58.660 --> 02:21:02.500
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: will be definitely adversely affected.

asr-002315
02:21:03.220 --> 02:21:04.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you very much, Madam Chair,

asr-002316
02:21:04.900 --> 02:21:06.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: for that very definitive statement.

asr-002317
02:21:07.040 --> 02:21:09.580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nakita po natin na sa halip na dagdagan,

asr-002318
02:21:09.740 --> 02:21:10.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: binawasan pa.

asr-002319
02:21:10.980 --> 02:21:13.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Hindi man lang at par with inflation,

asr-002320
02:21:13.720 --> 02:21:15.860
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: yung dapat sana increase sa budget

asr-002321
02:21:15.860 --> 02:21:17.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng ating mga SUC.

asr-002322
02:21:17.240 --> 02:21:19.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sinasabi po natin na may learning crisis tayo.

asr-002323
02:21:20.020 --> 02:21:20.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At totoo po 'yan,

asr-002324
02:21:20.920 --> 02:21:22.860
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: mula basic ed hanggang tertiary education.

asr-002325
02:21:23.340 --> 02:21:25.620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At isa pong dapat sisihin, ang budget.

asr-002326
02:21:26.060 --> 02:21:27.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kung priority po ang edukasyon,

asr-002327
02:21:27.860 --> 02:21:28.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: dapat binibigyan ng resources.

asr-002328
02:21:29.320 --> 02:21:30.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kapag tinatanggalan ng resources,

asr-002329
02:21:30.980 --> 02:21:33.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ibig sabihin, hindi priority ng gobyerno ito.

asr-002330
02:21:34.600 --> 02:21:37.640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Punta po tayo sa isang issue na talagang malapit sa puso ko.

asr-002331
02:21:37.660 --> 02:21:39.360
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito po yung Philippine General Hospital.

asr-002332
02:21:39.740 --> 02:21:42.060
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasi po, pag binawasan ang budget ng UP,

asr-002333
02:21:42.180 --> 02:21:43.720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: tatamaan siyempre ang PGH.

asr-002334
02:21:44.100 --> 02:21:45.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At ito po sa PGH,

asr-002335
02:21:45.760 --> 02:21:48.620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: nabawasan pa po ng 10% ang kanilang budget.

asr-002336
02:21:49.240 --> 02:21:50.400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Napakahalaga po ng PGH

asr-002337
02:21:50.400 --> 02:21:52.120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: sa libo-libo nating mga kababayan

asr-002338
02:21:52.120 --> 02:21:54.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: na dito umaasa araw-araw.

asr-002339
02:21:54.180 --> 02:21:55.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kahit mahaba ang pila,

asr-002340
02:21:55.320 --> 02:21:56.120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: sinatsaga

asr-002341
02:21:56.120 --> 02:21:58.400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: kasi maganda ang kalidad ng serbisyo.

asr-002342
02:21:58.560 --> 02:22:00.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa PGH din po,

asr-002343
02:22:00.120 --> 02:22:02.440
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: yung isa sa pinupuntahan ng mga tulad ko,

asr-002344
02:22:02.480 --> 02:22:03.480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng mga stroke survivor.

asr-002345
02:22:04.000 --> 02:22:08.380
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang PGH po ang may pinaka-advanced na stroke center sa Pilipinas.

asr-002346
02:22:08.840 --> 02:22:12.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So with this budget cut po of 805 million pesos

asr-002347
02:22:12.600 --> 02:22:14.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: sa PGH budget,

asr-002348
02:22:14.300 --> 02:22:16.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ano po kaya yung maapektuhang serbisyo?

asr-002349
02:22:16.320 --> 02:22:18.420
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At bakit po ulit nangyayari ang ganito?

