CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yes po. Marami pong salamat sa tanong, Honorable Congressman.

asr-003900
03:46:02.910 --> 03:46:08.630
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Ang CHED ay isa rin ito sa aming priority program.

asr-003901
03:46:08.630 --> 03:46:21.250
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: But as I have said, before we can come up with or strengthen an existing policy and come up with a new program, we really know what is happening in the ground.

asr-003902
03:46:21.250 --> 03:46:28.050
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So we really conducted a CHED student survey safety analytical portal.

asr-003903
03:46:28.470 --> 03:46:42.990
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So any student across these 5.8 million students are free to visit our website at ilalagay nila yung mga complaints nila.

asr-003904
03:46:42.990 --> 03:47:07.350
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And one of the five top incidents na nakuha namin is bullying, intimidation, and hazing, person-directed violence and threat, digital and online threats, property-related incidents, transport and community safety, dormitory and boarding house safety.

asr-003905
03:47:07.350 --> 03:47:20.250
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Ito po yung data namin ngayon, but we also identified the best practices and those concerns that are not addressed.

asr-003906
03:47:20.410 --> 03:47:28.630
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yun po yung basis namin sa pag-come up ng pag-strengthen ng existing policy or new policy po.

asr-003907
03:47:28.630 --> 03:47:34.890
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Madami po kaming na-identify ding good practices nila, tulad ng security.

asr-003908
03:47:35.230 --> 03:47:39.270
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: There is a security personnel assigned now sa mga buildings.

asr-003909
03:47:39.910 --> 03:47:44.950
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Functional guard post, controlled entry-exit, nako-control na po.

asr-003910
03:47:45.170 --> 03:47:49.270
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: The ID and visitor registration are strictly implemented.

asr-003911
03:47:49.950 --> 03:47:53.190
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Adequate surrounding lighting, ini-encourage namin.

asr-003912
03:47:53.310 --> 03:47:57.110
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: In fact, we have a proposal to have a net zero campus

asr-003913
03:47:57.110 --> 03:48:00.910
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: para po hindi all through the night may light.

asr-003914
03:48:01.250 --> 03:48:04.030
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Emergency alarm public address system.

asr-003915
03:48:05.450 --> 03:48:07.110
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: 24-hour security deployment.

asr-003916
03:48:07.470 --> 03:48:08.350
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Functional CCTV.

asr-003917
03:48:09.070 --> 03:48:14.970
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Itong functional CCTV po, lahat ng mga SUCs are required to have this.

asr-003918
03:48:14.970 --> 03:48:19.250
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: But part of their budget na inilalagay nila ngayon,

asr-003919
03:48:19.250 --> 03:48:20.770
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: and then vehicle gate control.

asr-003920
03:48:21.110 --> 03:48:23.450
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So lahat po ito mino-monitor namin,

asr-003921
03:48:23.590 --> 03:48:27.990
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: yung mga possible windows where we can

asr-003922
03:48:27.990 --> 03:48:30.650
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: minimize external intrusion to the

asr-003923
03:48:30.650 --> 03:48:34.030
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: campus. On top of this, we are revisiting

asr-003924
03:48:34.030 --> 03:48:35.630
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: the safety spaces guidelines.

asr-003925
03:48:39.250 --> 03:48:40.730
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Maraming salamat po.

