03:52:27.340 --> 03:52:31.140
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: deficiency of free higher education in the past four years,

asr-003974
03:52:31.140 --> 03:52:35.180
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: we have released publicly yung joint memorandum circular.

asr-003975
03:52:35.620 --> 03:52:37.620
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Between CHED and DBM.

asr-003976
03:52:38.000 --> 03:52:39.080
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Nandun po yun.

asr-003977
03:52:39.540 --> 03:52:45.660
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: But for the 2025, ay...

asr-003978
03:52:45.660 --> 03:52:48.340
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: 2025, 2026, na meron na naman.

asr-003979
03:52:48.980 --> 03:52:51.120
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: It is another brewing deficiency.

asr-003980
03:52:51.900 --> 03:52:53.940
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Pero na, natinitingnan namin.

asr-003981
03:52:54.540 --> 03:52:58.080
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So, as to the calculation, we came to an agreement

asr-003982
03:52:58.080 --> 03:53:02.620
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: na before 1 is to 25 yung faculty-student ratio.

asr-003983
03:53:02.620 --> 03:53:04.980
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Pero, it is so unrealistic.

asr-003984
03:53:04.980 --> 03:53:07.980
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: The lower, mas maraming nababayaran.

asr-003985
03:53:08.720 --> 03:53:13.040
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Pero, sa totoo lang naman, okay naman yung 1 is to 40.

asr-003986
03:53:13.640 --> 03:53:15.280
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So, yun yung basis namin.

asr-003987
03:53:15.420 --> 03:53:18.940
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Kasi, it's very unrealistic to impose on 1 is to 25.

asr-003988
03:53:19.160 --> 03:53:21.280
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Eh, lalong maraming hindi mababayaran.

asr-003989
03:53:21.880 --> 03:53:24.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So, we are agreeing now with PASUC and DBM

asr-003990
03:53:24.740 --> 03:53:29.860
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: na we will use the 1 is to 40 student-faculty ratio.

asr-003991
03:53:29.860 --> 03:53:30.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Okay.

asr-003992
03:53:30.860 --> 03:53:34.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kung maaari po makapagsubmit din po ng documentation on that,

asr-003993
03:53:34.980 --> 03:53:37.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to the committee, through the committee,

asr-003994
03:53:37.560 --> 03:53:40.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yun din po yung na-foresee natin last year, no,

asr-003995
03:53:40.440 --> 03:53:42.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na magkakaroon ng ganong deficiency.

asr-003996
03:53:42.720 --> 03:53:45.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero, kung kaya naman pong aksyonan sa pinakakagyat

asr-003997
03:53:45.540 --> 03:53:47.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: para hindi na lumaki, no,

asr-003998
03:53:48.760 --> 03:53:52.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yun po ang gusto natin i-endeavor for this budget season.

asr-003999
03:53:53.260 --> 03:53:55.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung next question ko na lang din po,

asr-004000
03:53:55.640 --> 03:53:57.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dahil na-mention na po yung PASUC,

asr-004001
03:53:57.520 --> 03:53:59.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: o napag-alaman po namin na

asr-004002
03:53:59.260 --> 03:54:01.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dito po sa Congress, at least,

asr-004003
03:54:01.600 --> 03:54:04.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na pag-uusapan po namin yung ano po yung,

asr-004004
03:54:04.980 --> 03:54:09.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: steps para may pagpondo sa inaasahang inflation

asr-004005
03:54:09.740 --> 03:54:11.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dulot ng fuel crisis.

asr-004006
03:54:12.300 --> 03:54:13.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But, ahead of that,

asr-004007
03:54:13.640 --> 03:54:15.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: meron na pong joint memorandum circular,

asr-004008
03:54:16.440 --> 03:54:17.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang DBM,

asr-004009
03:54:17.620 --> 03:54:20.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na nag-request na at least yung

asr-004010
03:54:20.440 --> 03:54:23.720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 20% ng MOOE,

asr-004011
03:54:24.260 --> 03:54:24.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na mukhang,

asr-004012
03:54:25.400 --> 03:54:27.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang sabi po sa amin ay galing sa

asr-004013
03:54:27.320 --> 03:54:30.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: unutilized savings,

asr-004014
03:54:30.200 --> 03:54:34.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ay ibalik po sa treasury,

asr-004015
03:54:34.980 --> 03:54:36.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or at least sa government.

asr-004016
03:54:37.040 --> 03:54:39.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang rinig po natin sa PASUC,

asr-004017
03:54:39.520 --> 03:54:41.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ay may sinumiti po silang appeal

asr-004018
03:54:41.900 --> 03:54:43.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na hindi po mapasailalim.

asr-004019
03:54:43.860 --> 03:54:46.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And ang update sa atin ng DBM ay denied po,

asr-004020
03:54:46.420 --> 03:54:47.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at least, yung appeal na yun.

asr-004021
03:54:48.180 --> 03:54:49.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: We may check with DBM later,

asr-004022
03:54:49.720 --> 03:54:52.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pero pwede pong matanong kung asan po ba ang CHED dito.

asr-004023
03:54:53.380 --> 03:54:55.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May posisyon po po sila doon sa

asr-004024
03:54:55.420 --> 03:54:57.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: posisyon, essentially, ng PASUC na

asr-004025
03:54:57.900 --> 03:55:01.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: huwag po sanang bawasan yung 20% MOOE

asr-004026
03:55:01.040 --> 03:55:03.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng state universities and colleges.

asr-004027
03:55:04.980 --> 03:55:10.960
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: May I answer you as former president of a university?

asr-004028
03:55:11.960 --> 03:55:14.300
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Ang stand ko po, sana as much as possible,

asr-004029
03:55:14.640 --> 03:55:19.460
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: considering the many changing landscape in higher education,

asr-004030
03:55:20.080 --> 03:55:21.840
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: sana po hindi na magalaw yun.

asr-004031
03:55:22.500 --> 03:55:26.900
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Especially to the fact na this 2027,

asr-004032
03:55:27.360 --> 03:55:30.520
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: bumaba yung budget ng SUC,

asr-004033
03:55:30.520 --> 03:55:34.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: and then worse, parang marami sa kanila zero

asr-004034
03:55:34.740 --> 03:55:36.640
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: ang kanilang infrastructure.

asr-004035
03:55:36.900 --> 03:55:40.280
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So, yun po yung stand ko.

asr-004036
03:55:40.360 --> 03:55:42.720
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Kung ako ang presidente, ipaglalaban ko.

asr-004037
03:55:43.420 --> 03:55:44.880
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Pero nasa CHED kasi ako,

asr-004038
03:55:45.040 --> 03:55:46.040
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: so I have to comply.

asr-004039
03:55:46.160 --> 03:55:47.260
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Magsauli naman kami.

asr-004040
03:55:47.880 --> 03:55:49.020
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Nagsauli po kami.

asr-004041
03:55:49.920 --> 03:55:51.040
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yeah, nagsauli po kami.

asr-004042
03:55:52.960 --> 03:55:57.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, bahagi din po ng kampanya na bibit-bitin this budget season.

asr-004043
03:55:57.240 --> 03:56:00.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: We are aware that out of the 113 or 114

asr-004044
03:56:00.860 --> 03:56:02.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: state universities and colleges,

asr-004045
03:56:03.000 --> 03:56:06.020
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: 113 state universities and colleges,

asr-004047
03:56:06.920 --> 03:56:08.900
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: 554 including campuses.

asr-004048
03:56:09.320 --> 03:56:09.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yes po.

asr-004049
03:56:10.740 --> 03:56:14.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At least sa 130 na ito, 49 po ang may budget cut.

asr-004050
03:56:15.060 --> 03:56:17.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, nakakalungkot siyang pakinggan at makita

asr-004051
03:56:20.900 --> 03:56:24.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dahil kahit na gusto natin na highest budgetary priority

asr-004052
03:56:24.300 --> 03:56:25.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang edukasyon,

asr-004053
03:56:25.980 --> 03:56:28.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: it's unfortunate na bababa yung budget nila

asr-004054
03:56:28.460 --> 03:56:29.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: compared to last year.

asr-004055
03:56:29.740 --> 03:56:31.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, yun naman din po yung ipaglalaban at least natin

asr-004056
03:56:31.880 --> 03:56:33.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: for state universities and colleges.

asr-004057
03:56:34.220 --> 03:56:36.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Matanggal yung budget cut, ma-restore sila.

asr-004058
03:56:36.640 --> 03:56:40.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And kung may wish list po para po sa ma-aprubahan,

asr-004059
03:56:40.560 --> 03:56:43.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ay ipaglalaban natin na mapondohan po siya

asr-004060
03:56:43.080 --> 03:56:46.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: for this budget cycle again.

asr-004061
03:56:46.620 --> 03:56:52.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But nonetheless, para po sa 20% MOOE,

asr-004062
03:56:52.700 --> 03:56:56.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: we also echo yung sinabi ng PASUC

asr-004063
03:56:56.760 --> 03:57:00.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and we're in talks with DBM kung paano po,

asr-004064
03:57:00.260 --> 03:57:01.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ano po yung pwedeng magawa doon.

asr-004065
03:57:01.960 --> 03:57:04.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung last na lang po na question, Madam Chair,

asr-004066
03:57:05.320 --> 03:57:06.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: is in relation,

asr-004067
03:57:06.480 --> 03:57:10.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: doon sa Student Welfare Guidelines of HEIS.

asr-004068
03:57:11.320 --> 03:57:15.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: We're appreciative of the draft na na-share po

asr-004069
03:57:15.140 --> 03:57:22.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: of student SAS na draft na po ng CHED.

asr-004070
03:57:22.500 --> 03:57:26.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May I request an update po na if after this draft,

asr-004071
03:57:26.480 --> 03:57:28.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: meron na po ba itong implementation phase?

asr-004072
03:57:29.920 --> 03:57:32.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meron na po ba itong finalization pa?

asr-004073
03:57:38.140 --> 03:57:38.780
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yeah.

asr-004074
03:57:39.800 --> 03:57:40.560
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: The record is,

asr-004075
03:57:41.220 --> 03:57:42.220
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: is here,

asr-004076
03:57:42.840 --> 03:57:44.760
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: yung CMO number 18,

asr-004077
03:57:44.900 --> 03:57:46.320
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: series of 2026,

asr-004078
03:57:46.760 --> 03:57:49.280
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: after a series of consultation,

asr-004079
03:57:49.480 --> 03:57:53.480
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: we already issued April 6, 2026,

asr-004080
03:57:53.660 --> 03:57:56.620
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: and the consultation and deployment of this

asr-004081
03:57:56.620 --> 03:57:57.700
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: is already ongoing.

asr-004082
03:57:58.280 --> 03:57:58.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Okay, sige.

asr-004083
03:57:58.800 --> 03:57:59.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you po.

asr-004084
03:57:59.500 --> 03:58:02.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May final manifestation na lang po sana ako, Madam Chair,

asr-004085
03:58:03.340 --> 03:58:05.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: since nabasa po namin yung guidelines

asr-004086
03:58:05.800 --> 03:58:08.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at natuwa po kami doon sa paano na po

asr-004087
03:58:08.900 --> 03:58:10.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: protectahan yung organizations,

asr-004088
03:58:11.220 --> 03:58:13.420
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: publications, and councils,

asr-004089
03:58:13.560 --> 03:58:14.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: mapanghawakan po sana.

asr-004090
03:58:15.760 --> 03:58:17.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero ang nakikita po natin sa mga guidelines,

asr-004091
03:58:18.140 --> 03:58:20.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: bago po itong CMO,

asr-004092
03:58:20.920 --> 03:58:24.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung mga dating handbooks ng iba't-ibang state universities

asr-004093
03:58:24.120 --> 03:58:27.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and colleges, or even private universities,

asr-004094
03:58:27.640 --> 03:58:29.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: meron po silang penalty clauses,

asr-004095
03:58:29.520 --> 03:58:32.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: may suspension, expulsion, etc.,

asr-004096
03:58:32.900 --> 03:58:35.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at meron po dito na bumabanggan na

asr-004097
03:58:35.900 --> 03:58:37.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa karapatan ng mga kabataan

asr-004098
03:58:37.800 --> 03:58:40.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na dapat, hindi naman po,

asr-004099
03:58:40.460 --> 03:58:41.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: they don't shed it

asr-004101
03:58:41.200 --> 03:58:43.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: when they step into school gates.

asr-004102
03:58:44.240 --> 03:58:46.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And in particular, gusto ko pong i-highlight,

asr-004103
03:58:46.500 --> 03:58:48.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: meron pong kaso na hinaharap

asr-004104
03:58:48.300 --> 03:58:49.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang ilang mga leader-studyante,

asr-004105
03:58:49.880 --> 03:58:52.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: for example, sa Universidad de Santo Tomas,

asr-004106
03:58:52.960 --> 03:58:55.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: para po sa pag-exercise nila

asr-004107
03:58:55.380 --> 03:58:57.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng academic freedom.

asr-004108
03:58:57.520 --> 03:58:59.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And when we say academic freedom,

asr-004109
03:59:00.160 --> 03:59:01.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na bahagi po siya

asr-004110
03:59:01.180 --> 03:59:03.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: in part and parcel of scientific progress.

asr-004111
03:59:04.260 --> 03:59:07.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hindi po sana maging sagka

asr-004112
03:59:07.660 --> 03:59:11.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung kanilang exercise of these rights and freedoms.

asr-004113
03:59:11.200 --> 03:59:14.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sa kanilang pag-tuloy-tuloy

asr-004114
03:59:14.740 --> 03:59:17.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: bilang mga estudyante sa paaralan.

asr-004115
03:59:17.680 --> 03:59:19.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So pwede po nalang po bang magkaroon ng commitment

asr-004116
03:59:19.760 --> 03:59:21.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na may further dialogue with CHED

asr-004117
03:59:21.540 --> 03:59:24.720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: para po makita at mabantayan yung implementation

asr-004118
03:59:24.720 --> 03:59:26.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng CMO 18-2026.

asr-004119
03:59:27.300 --> 03:59:29.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At kung meron pong mga hindi pa po

asr-004120
03:59:29.320 --> 03:59:33.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sumasang-ayon ng mga higher educational institutions

asr-004121
03:59:33.060 --> 03:59:33.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa guidelines,

asr-004122
03:59:34.200 --> 03:59:37.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ay ma-remind na may existing memo in place

asr-004123
03:59:37.200 --> 03:59:38.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sana po masunod.

asr-004124
03:59:38.740 --> 03:59:40.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: That is my last question, Madam Chair.

asr-004125
03:59:40.320 --> 03:59:41.180
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Just to give

asr-004126
03:59:41.200 --> 03:59:42.380
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: an answer po.

asr-004127
03:59:42.740 --> 03:59:44.120
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yes po, Kong.

asr-004128
03:59:44.200 --> 03:59:46.560
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: We were very serious

asr-004129
03:59:46.560 --> 03:59:49.920
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: nung nag-manifest ang estudyante sa amin

asr-004130
03:59:49.920 --> 03:59:52.620
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: na to open a consultation with them

asr-004131
03:59:52.620 --> 03:59:53.900
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: among student leaders.

asr-004132
03:59:54.060 --> 03:59:55.040
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: We started already.

asr-004133
03:59:55.540 --> 03:59:58.680
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And that note from the University of Santo Tomas,

asr-004134
03:59:58.820 --> 04:00:00.180
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: we will be, this will be

asr-004135
04:00:00.180 --> 04:00:02.000
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: part of the

asr-004136
04:00:02.000 --> 04:00:03.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: manifestation of our director

asr-004137
04:00:03.740 --> 04:00:05.600
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: during the regular consultation.

asr-004138
04:00:05.800 --> 04:00:07.600
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Meron na po kaming regular consultation.

asr-004139
04:00:07.920 --> 04:00:10.020
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: And the memo was issued

asr-004140
04:00:10.020 --> 04:00:10.340
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: August.

asr-004140-split-1
04:00:10.840 --> 04:00:12.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Sige, thank you po.

asr-004141
04:00:12.500 --> 04:00:14.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And partner niyo po kami na

asr-004142
04:00:14.040 --> 04:00:15.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to ensure na yung mga rights and freedoms

asr-004143
04:00:15.980 --> 04:00:18.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng students inside

asr-004144
04:00:18.340 --> 04:00:20.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: the higher

asr-004145
04:00:20.080 --> 04:00:21.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: educational institutions ay

asr-004146
04:00:21.980 --> 04:00:24.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi lang respected pero nakaka-contribute

asr-004147
04:00:24.180 --> 04:00:26.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa paano paglingkod sa bayan,

asr-004148
04:00:26.340 --> 04:00:28.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa mamamayan. Maraming salamat po

asr-004149
04:00:28.060 --> 04:00:29.740
