asr-004628
04:17:17.820 --> 04:17:22.920
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: magra-graduate na po because of the many intervening policy in between

asr-004629
04:17:22.920 --> 04:17:24.100
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: ng release.

asr-004630
04:17:24.100 --> 04:17:24.820
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Like the...

asr-004631
04:17:24.820 --> 04:17:31.960
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: The unliquidated policy, na kung may unliquidated program ang SUC,

asr-004632
04:17:32.040 --> 04:17:35.760
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: hindi na madadownloadan in any forms kahit scholarship.

asr-004633
04:17:35.760 --> 04:17:41.740
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So, ang naisipan po namin na makipag-partner sa Land Bank.

asr-004634
04:17:42.000 --> 04:17:48.020
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Again, ang Land Bank naman is open with or without the CHED program with Land Bank.

asr-004635
04:17:48.100 --> 04:17:50.300
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Pwede naman mag-open yung mga bata.

asr-004636
04:17:50.300 --> 04:17:54.580
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: But kung sila yung mag-open outside this program,

asr-004637
04:17:54.900 --> 04:17:59.800
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: ay meron silang maintaining balance na mahirap i-maintain ng estudyante.

asr-004638
04:17:59.800 --> 04:18:02.400
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So, under this CHED Land Bank program,

asr-004639
04:18:02.700 --> 04:18:06.400
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: ay walang, walang, walang maintaining balance

asr-004640
