asr-005602
05:19:57.700 --> 05:19:58.820
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: What else?

asr-005603
05:20:04.120 --> 05:20:08.960
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Yeah, institutional development platform.

asr-005604
05:20:09.930 --> 05:20:12.360
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: So kung yun po ay mamit,

asr-005605
05:20:12.420 --> 05:20:14.840
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: and then if you are referring...

