asr-005649
05:22:45.520 --> 05:22:47.840
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: the investment of the government is,

asr-005650
05:22:47.840 --> 05:22:49.760
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: will be in, ano,

asr-005651
05:22:49.760 --> 05:22:51.920
