asr-006873
08:17:22.080 --> 08:17:28.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Nagkakwentuhan po kami nila, Vice Chair Monique, nila SDS, last year, ganitong oras, nagdi-dinner break pa lang.

asr-006874
08:17:28.540 --> 08:17:33.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And we ended at around 11.30 in the evening last year.

asr-006875
08:17:33.080 --> 08:17:34.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Now we're at 7.30.

asr-006876
08:17:34.060 --> 08:17:38.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Mas maaga pa sana kung hindi ako na nag-cause ng delay.

asr-006877
08:17:38.080 --> 08:17:38.840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sorry about that.

asr-006878
08:17:38.960 --> 08:17:45.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But I think that's really a testament to how much the performance of CHED has improved from last year.

asr-006880
08:17:45.620 --> 08:17:46.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And this year.

asr-006881
08:17:46.880 --> 08:17:51.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So we would like to commend all of you po.

asr-006882
08:17:51.480 --> 08:17:55.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: As Chair Shirley was saying, this wasn't a one-person job.

asr-006883
08:17:55.560 --> 08:18:05.700
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: This was a result of all the hard work of every man and woman outside, behind Chair Shirley in the CHED family.

asr-006884
08:18:05.700 --> 08:18:08.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So again, thank you so much po.

asr-006885
08:18:08.240 --> 08:18:12.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: There is still lots to do as we discussed.

asr-006886
08:18:12.080 --> 08:18:20.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But I know with Chair Shirley there at the helm, CHED will do even better in the next months and in the coming years.

asr-006887
08:18:20.280 --> 08:18:21.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So thank you.

asr-006888
08:18:21.180 --> 08:18:23.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you again to the CHED family.

asr-006889
08:18:23.500 --> 08:18:25.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And that's it po.

asr-006890
08:18:25.980 --> 08:18:31.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I'll defer back again to Vice Chair Monique Lagdameo.

asr-006891
08:18:31.180 --> 08:18:31.900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much po.

asr-006892
08:18:32.080 --> 08:18:32.860
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Thank you, Chair.

asr-006893
08:18:33.020 --> 08:18:45.020
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: And just a reminder to the CHED family, we will be expecting all the submissions discussed earlier and requested by the members who asked for it earlier in the day.

asr-006894
08:18:50.040 --> 08:18:50.640
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Yes,

asr-006895
08:18:50.720 --> 08:18:55.060
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: and then the letter discussed now with Chair for the requests

asr-006896
08:18:55.060 --> 08:19:08.900
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: and with the prioritization, we are requesting that you give it in by the first half of next week, just so that it can be discussed properly and makahabol po kung ano po ang kaya namin maihabol.

asr-006897
08:19:09.620 --> 08:19:11.000
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: So with that...

asr-006898
08:19:11.880 --> 08:19:23.740
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Before I move for the termination, I'd like to inform si Chair Shirley na I provided funding to repair my regional office.

asr-006899
08:19:24.640 --> 08:19:25.180
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Kasi hindi

asr-006900
08:19:25.180 --> 08:19:26.860
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: naman niyo yun mapapagawa, ako yung magpapagawa

asr-006901
08:19:26.900 --> 08:19:28.060
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Ako na lang yung magpapagawa.

asr-006902
08:19:28.440 --> 08:19:29.140
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Salamat po.

asr-006903
08:19:29.200 --> 08:19:30.300
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Papalitan natin.

asr-006904
08:19:30.580 --> 08:19:32.580
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: At saka alam mo na ano kapalit niyan.

asr-006905
08:19:32.800 --> 08:19:34.640
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Dagdagan mo yung scholarship ko.

asr-006906
08:19:35.640 --> 08:19:46.820
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Madam Chair, I move that the committee terminate its hearing on the proposed fiscal year 2027 budget of the Commission on Higher Education

asr-006907
08:19:47.440 --> 08:19:51.400
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: under the House Bill No. 10858, I so move.

asr-006908
08:19:51.660 --> 08:19:52.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I second the motion.

asr-006910
08:19:54.560 --> 08:19:57.240
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: It has been moved and seconded.

asr-006911
08:19:57.560 --> 08:20:03.580
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: And duly seconded to terminate the hearing of the proposed 2027 budget of the CHED.

asr-006912
08:20:03.640 --> 08:20:04.520
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Is there any objection?

asr-006913
08:20:05.640 --> 08:20:06.820
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Chair hears none.

asr-006914
08:20:07.220 --> 08:20:09.360
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: The motion is now approved.

asr-006915
08:20:12.600 --> 08:20:18.380
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Thank you to our CHED family, of course, to our colleagues, to Chair, and to SDS who stayed with us.

asr-006916
08:20:18.540 --> 08:20:23.160
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: And we likewise thank the members who participated actively earlier.

asr-006917
08:20:23.580 --> 08:20:25.260
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: So again, a pleasant evening to all.

asr-006918
08:20:25.340 --> 08:20:25.760
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Thank you po.

asr-006920
08:20:26.620 --> 08:20:28.960
