asr-006921
08:20:28.960 --> 08:20:30.660
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: One more motion po, Madam Chair.

asr-006922
08:20:30.820 --> 08:20:31.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-006923
08:20:32.560 --> 08:20:35.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I move that we suspend.

asr-006924
08:20:47.440 --> 08:20:59.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I move that we suspend the committee hearing here at Nograles Hall on House Bill No. 10858 until Tuesday, September 1, 2026 at 9 o'clock in the morning.

asr-006925
08:21:00.220 --> 08:21:00.840
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: I second.

asr-006926
08:21:03.560 --> 08:21:04.500
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: Thank you.

asr-006927
08:21:04.500 --> 08:21:12.160
Rep. Monique Yazmin Maria Q. Lagdameo: So, consideration of the House Bill is now suspended until September 1, Tuesday, 2026.

asr-006928
08:21:12.560 --> 08:21:13.720
CHED Chairperson Shirley Castañeda Agrupis: Thank you so much po.

